            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present invention is directed to oil compositions that are enriched in polyunsaturated fatty acids; compositions containing the enriched oil compositions; and methods of making and using the enriched oil compositions. The oil is preferably a microbial or marine oil.</p>
